WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:02.767
Welcome, welcome to
"The Tonight Show."

00:00:02.767 --> 00:00:04.734
You're here. You made it.
Thank you for watching at home.

00:00:04.734 --> 00:00:07.467
[ Cheers and applause ]
I appreciate it.

00:00:07.467 --> 00:00:09.000
Well, guys,
everyone's talking about this.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.200
Today, Elon Musk bought Twitter
for $44 billion.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:17.801
Yep, he now owns
SpaceX and Twitter.

00:00:17.801 --> 00:00:20.467
It's like Musk is thinking,
"I've seen the heavens.

00:00:20.467 --> 00:00:22.400
Now on to hell."

00:00:24.667 --> 00:00:26.133
Twitter's an odd thing to buy.

00:00:26.133 --> 00:00:27.434
You know, it's like buying
YouTube and saying,

00:00:27.434 --> 00:00:28.467
"Forget the videos.

00:00:28.467 --> 00:00:31.334
I'm just here for
the mean comments."

00:00:31.334 --> 00:00:33.968
That's right -- the richest man
in the world bought Twitter.

00:00:33.968 --> 00:00:35.601
Right now,
Bernie Sanders is so mad,

00:00:35.601 --> 00:00:37.300
he just turned into the Hulk.

00:00:39.133 --> 00:00:42.300
Yeah, Musk has said
that he's pro-free speech,

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:43.434
so a lot of people
think that he'll let

00:00:43.434 --> 00:00:47.167
former president
Trump back on the platform.

00:00:47.167 --> 00:00:48.534
Yeah, not exactly what we meant

00:00:48.534 --> 00:00:50.734
when we asked for a return
to pre-pandemic vibes.

00:00:50.734 --> 00:00:56.167
But when it heard, the caps-lock
key on Trump's phone was like,

00:00:56.167 --> 00:00:58.400
"I'm back, baby!"

00:00:58.400 --> 00:00:59.901
But listen to this.

00:00:59.901 --> 00:01:02.901
Today, Trump told Fox News that
he will not return to Twitter

00:01:02.901 --> 00:01:06.901
and will instead join
his own platform, Truth Social.

00:01:08.567 --> 00:01:11.267
Wait. So not even Trump
is on Truth Social yet?

00:01:11.267 --> 00:01:13.634
That is -- It's his app.

00:01:13.634 --> 00:01:15.701
He's not on his own app?

00:01:15.701 --> 00:01:17.834
If you're keeping track,
Twitter and Truth Social

00:01:17.834 --> 00:01:21.634
are like the Four Seasons and
Four Seasons Total Landscaping.

00:01:24.067 --> 00:01:26.767
That's right -- Trump's not
giving up on Truth Social,

00:01:26.767 --> 00:01:28.934
but at a rally this weekend,
he somehow managed

00:01:28.934 --> 00:01:31.033
to mess up the name of
his own platform.

00:01:31.033 --> 00:01:32.067
Take a look at this.

00:01:32.067 --> 00:01:34.334
-Because of
this digital tyranny,

00:01:34.334 --> 00:01:36.968
we had to give the
American people their voice back

00:01:36.968 --> 00:01:42.267
by building something called
Troth -- Truth Sential.

00:01:42.267 --> 00:01:44.100
Truth Social.

00:01:44.200 --> 00:01:49.000
[ Laughter, cymbal crash ]

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:51.400
[ As Trump ] Tough Socials.

00:01:52.834 --> 00:01:54.934
Trout Chapel.

00:01:56.501 --> 00:01:58.934
"Thor: Ragnarok."

00:02:00.100 --> 00:02:03.133
Sadly, even Trout Central has
more users than Truth Social.

00:02:03.133 --> 00:02:04.133
It's interesting.

00:02:04.133 --> 00:02:05.267
Let's switch gears.

00:02:05.267 --> 00:02:06.567
Over the past couple weeks,
there's been

00:02:06.567 --> 00:02:08.901
a rise in COVID cases,
and The White House

00:02:08.901 --> 00:02:12.834
is calling for
caution but not overreacting.

00:02:12.834 --> 00:02:16.834
Even the CDC was like,
"What the hell does that mean?"

00:02:16.834 --> 00:02:17.934
You know it's really bad when

00:02:17.934 --> 00:02:20.767
Elon Musk tries to buy
Clorox Wipes.

00:02:21.667 --> 00:02:23.100
Some more news from
The White House.

00:02:23.100 --> 00:02:26.000
Today, the Tampa Bay Lightning
visited President Biden

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:29.501
to celebrate their last
two Stanley Cup championships.

00:02:29.501 --> 00:02:31.501
Yep. Sure.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:33.100 --> 00:02:35.300
That's good.

00:02:35.300 --> 00:02:37.200
Biden said he's not a
big Lightning fan,

00:02:37.200 --> 00:02:39.133
but his childhood friend
Ben Franklin is.

00:02:39.133 --> 00:02:40.634
Yeah, and...

00:02:44.067 --> 00:02:45.100
Well, hey, get this.

00:02:45.100 --> 00:02:46.767
Chippendales has
hired a lobbyist

00:02:46.767 --> 00:02:49.834
to help them get
federal COVID aid.

00:02:49.834 --> 00:02:52.067
Yeah, they'll receive
their money,

00:02:52.067 --> 00:02:54.033
but they're just going to
get it like this.

00:02:54.033 --> 00:02:58.801
♪♪

00:02:58.801 --> 00:03:00.067
Some more business news.

00:03:00.067 --> 00:03:02.234
I read that the owners of
JCPenney have offered

00:03:02.234 --> 00:03:06.033
to buy Kohl's for $8.6 billion.

00:03:06.033 --> 00:03:08.534
Meanwhile, Best Buy is
calling up RadioShack like,

00:03:08.534 --> 00:03:09.901
"You up?"

00:03:11.400 --> 00:03:13.100
And, finally,
a hiker in Washington

00:03:13.100 --> 00:03:15.601
had to call the fire department
to rescue her

00:03:15.601 --> 00:03:18.667
after she dropped her phone in
an outhouse toilet

00:03:18.667 --> 00:03:21.567
and got stuck headfirst
trying to get it out.

00:03:24.300 --> 00:03:25.701
It's actually hard
for her to get in touch

00:03:25.701 --> 00:03:28.267
with the fire department because
she had such crappy service.

00:03:28.267 --> 00:03:29.701
And...

00:03:31.200 --> 00:03:32.767
Firefighters were like,
"There's no fire,

00:03:32.767 --> 00:03:34.767
but you'd better
bring the hose."

00:03:35.567 --> 00:03:37.901
Guys, I know a lot of
people find math boring.

00:03:37.901 --> 00:03:39.300
Well, that's why
we've updated math

00:03:39.300 --> 00:03:41.901
to make equations be about
stuff that you can relate to.

00:03:41.901 --> 00:03:43.901
It's time for
"Popular Mathematics."

00:03:43.901 --> 00:03:46.234
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

00:03:46.234 --> 00:03:47.667
-♪ Popular ♪

00:03:47.667 --> 00:03:49.200
♪ Mathematics ♪

00:03:49.267 --> 00:03:51.167
♪ Mathematics ♪

00:03:51.167 --> 00:03:53.434
-Let's take a look at
our first equation here.

00:03:53.434 --> 00:03:57.000
If you take a check mark
plus a dad bod,

00:03:57.000 --> 00:03:59.501
it equals the Nike logo.

00:04:02.434 --> 00:04:04.100
See what I'm saying?
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:06.634 --> 00:04:08.968
So, then if you take a
streaming service

00:04:08.968 --> 00:04:11.367
plus the movie
"Gone in 60 Seconds,"

00:04:11.367 --> 00:04:13.767
it equals CNN+.

00:04:15.100 --> 00:04:17.634
It makes you like math again.

00:04:18.601 --> 00:04:19.667
Here's another one.

00:04:19.667 --> 00:04:22.868
Mexican culture
plus Italian culture

00:04:22.868 --> 00:04:24.000
plus a middle finger

00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:27.167
equals Taco Bell's
Mexican pizza.

00:04:29.267 --> 00:04:30.701
I'm still going to try it.

00:04:30.701 --> 00:04:33.267
I'm still going to try it and
I'll probably like it.

00:04:33.267 --> 00:04:35.434
If you take an old-school camera

00:04:35.434 --> 00:04:37.734
plus shooting
the whole roll of film

00:04:37.734 --> 00:04:40.734
plus forgetting to take off
the lens cap,

00:04:40.734 --> 00:04:43.801
it equals Kodak Black.

00:04:43.801 --> 00:04:45.767
You understand?

00:04:47.934 --> 00:04:50.467
And, finally,
if you take positive vibes

00:04:50.467 --> 00:04:52.734
plus positive COVID test,
it equals Coachella.

00:04:52.734 --> 00:04:54.100
There you go.

00:04:54.100 --> 00:04:56.634
That's all the time we have for
"Popular Mathematics."

00:04:56.634 --> 00:04:57.634
We have a great show.

